 test

Data-driven provider list (assets/call_providers.json) parsed via kotlinx.serialization.
Pure availableOptions() decides VoIP-vs-deeplink-vs-omit; queryVoipDataIds() resolves
per-contact VoIP data rows. No UI wiring yet.
